WEBVTT

00:00:28.753 --> 00:00:30.107
And most importantly,

00:00:30.131 --> 00:00:33.730
true love will find you
when you least expect it."

00:00:34.336 --> 00:00:36.031
Now as it turns out,

00:00:36.055 --> 00:00:38.588
I'm somebody who thinks a lot about data,

00:00:38.612 --> 00:00:39.887
as you'll soon find.

00:00:39.911 --> 00:00:45.077
I am constantly swimming
in numbers, formulas and charts.

00:00:45.101 --> 00:00:47.477
I also have a very tight-knit family,

00:00:47.501 --> 00:00:49.488
and I'm very, very close with my sister,

00:00:49.512 --> 00:00:52.964
and as a result, I wanted to have
the same type of family when I grew up.

00:00:52.988 --> 00:00:54.861
So I'm at the end of this bad breakup,

00:00:54.885 --> 00:00:56.088
I'm 30 years old,

00:00:56.112 --> 00:00:59.815
I figure I'm probably going to have
to date somebody for about six months

00:00:59.839 --> 00:01:01.657
before I'm ready to get monogamous